  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_system_01",
      "hash64": "41A183A20EE70831",
      "text": "洛托洛托洛托……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_01",
      "hash64": "32422C00E4F946BF",
      "text": "……[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳搞定看門的了嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_02",
      "hash64": "32422D00E4F94872",
      "text": "這個基地的主人，\\n就是天星隊妖精幫班……\\r\\n閣道三小隊。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_03",
      "hash64": "32422E00E4F94A25",
      "text": "老大的奧爾迪加\\n負責天星隊的機械整備。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_04",
      "hash64": "32422700E4F93E40",
      "text": "在老大當中雖然他的年紀最小，\\n但確實有真本事。別小看他了。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_05",
      "hash64": "32422800E4F93FF3",
      "text": "比起親自行動，\\n基本上他屬於指揮別人行動的司令官類型。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_06",
      "hash64": "32422900E4F941A6",
      "text": "不過，他有點容易動怒。\\n一旦理智線斷裂，\\r\\n我想他就會親自闖入戰場。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_07",
      "hash64": "32422A00E4F94359",
      "text": "方法還是只有不斷打倒手下們了。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_08",
      "hash64": "32423300E4F952A4",
      "text": "在奧爾迪加現身之前，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要抵擋住手下們的猛攻啊。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_09",
      "hash64": "32423400E4F95457",
      "text": "[EMPTY 16]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
